---
/**
 * The right arrow from FreightSans Pro's ornaments, as the Figma mockup sets
 * it: the letter "J" with the `ornm` OpenType feature on. Use it inside
 * FreightSans text. Hidden from screen readers, which would read "J".
 */
---

<span aria-hidden="true" class="[font-feature-settings:'ornm']">J</span>
